"......"{w}{p}"Whatever his goals or interests were...{w}the one who brought me out of that prison...
...was him."{w}{p}"I wonder what he'd say
if I showed him this inscription...{w}Would it make him happy...?"{w}

"So you remembered...{w}That's right! We're family!
We all grew up together on the Princess's land!!"{w}{p}"Once again, the Princess's land hasn't actually been approved.{w}There's no start stamp carved on it.{w}And those so-called Kin of Darkness keep pouring in."{w}{p}"But none of that matters!{w}This time for sure, I've made up my mind to protect the Princess!!"{w}{p}"Gods or Kin of Darkness, I'll protect the Princess
even if I have to take 'em down with me!"{w}

"I hear you helped drive off the Kin of Darkness!
Thanks a lot."{w}{p}"No matter how much time goes by,
we really are comrades after all, huh...{w}I'm counting on you from here on out, too!!"{w}

{0E}                                              
         A Few Loves, Stirring to Life
                                              {0F}{w}

"My, what shameless people you are.{w}Do you truly believe you are qualified
to set foot in this place?"{w}{p}"Take your filthy feet off the Princess's land at once,
and get out. ...Or I shall kill you, you know?"{w}

{0E}                                              
      Souls of the In-Between, Come Unto Me
                                              {0F}{w}

"But I won't give up.{w}Even that Wraith is standing up to it."{w}{p}"My wish to save the souls of the in-between
is real, too..."{w}{p}"As long as I don't give up,
someday I'm sure I'll be able to help them!"{w}

{0E}                                              
          The Power Eater, and the Price
                                              {0F}{w}

"Curse you, interfering with my treatment...{w}I failed to take Finas Rade,
but I will not hand over this land."{w}{p}"Or perhaps, if I absorb you,
my body will return to what it was?"{w}

"So you're the new talent who wants to join us?{w}We've already hired plenty this term, but..."{w}{p}"Well, fine. Zeshrom investigated her far too much
while trying to win her over, drowned in sentiment,
and became useless."{w}{p}"If you don't mind filling in for him,
I'll test you, as a special favor.{w}Don't hold back. Come at me."{w}
